ection powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n          这是我们的第一次采购，目前还没有更多的资料，非常让我们惊讶的是这三个豆子的干净程度，特别是黄蜜处理批次，特别的干净和甜美，从高温到低温都很一致，又在要去的列表上多了一个地方～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;visibility: visible;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.5em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n              公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n             </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.5em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n              客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n             </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T63dGPyUPjictQZLtFjiafuZfP6JRomfrYRJyo2D4Tf0NvibBUZu9UP4VMYvReaLlu6bc42JoO24QdA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;width: 578px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
